## 八、完整对象关系图

```
docx.Document('file.docx')
    │
    ├── .paragraphs  → [Paragraph, ...]
    ├── .tables      → [Table, ...]
    ├── .sections    → Sections → [Section, ...]
    │                               ├── .page_width / .page_height
    │                               ├── .left_margin / .right_margin
    │                               ├── .orientation
    │                               ├── .header / .footer
    │                               └── .start_type
    ├── .styles      → Styles → {name: Style, ...}
    ├── .inline_shapes → InlineShapes → [InlineShape, ...]
    ├── .core_properties → CoreProperties
    └── .settings    → Settings

内部结构：
Document
  ._element  → CT_Document (<w:document>)
               └── CT_Body (<w:body>)
                     ├── CT_P (<w:p>) × N
                     ├── CT_Tbl (<w:tbl>) × M
                     └── CT_SectPr (<w:sectPr>)
  ._part     → DocumentPart
               ├── .styles    → StylesPart
               ├── .numbering → NumberingPart
               └── .settings  → SettingsPart
```

